75	    /**
76	     * Derive the membership number '&lt;customerCode&gt;-M&lt;YY&gt;', where YY is the last
77	     * two digits of the registration date year (e.g. 'SYD-SMI-0007-M26'). Returns null when
78	     * either source field is absent.
