5	 * the same household id, i.e. the same last name and postcode) without declaring it. Since a
6	 * household is keyed on (last name, postcode), such an owner is a household duplicate. Handled by
7	 * {@link HouseholdDuplicateExceptionHandler}, which responds 409 with the conflicting household
8	 * id and the existing owner's id. A request that sets {@code sharesHousehold} bypasses this block
